{"id":"n15888-2-11","stage":3,"title":"건설 · 建立","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15888-2-11-1","ko":"요즘은 신도시 개발에 관한 소식이 없네.","zh":"最近好像没有关于新城区开发的消息啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신도시","meaning":"新城，卫星城","explanation":"신도시：新城，卫星城","readings":[{"term":"신도시","audio":"/audio/e2fb80a5923c282ae865.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66198","senseId":"1","lemma":"신도시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개발에","meaning":"开发","explanation":"개발：开发；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"개발","audio":"/audio/a5ac2b7251f6a58b4a3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23460","senseId":"1","lemma":"개발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관한","meaning":"关于","explanation":"관하다：关于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"관하다","audio":"/audio/2df2c6b5d50b21ab463c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64365","senseId":"1","lemma":"관하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소식이","meaning":"消息","explanation":"소식：消息；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71143","senseId":"1","lemma":"소식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"e2fb80a5923c282a","term":"신도시","zh":"新城，卫星城","audio":"/audio/e2fb80a5923c282ae865.mp3","entryId":"66198","definitio