7d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분명해.","meaning":"肯定，分明，明明白白","explanation":"분명하다：肯定，分明，明明白白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"분명하다","audio":"/audio/f9798826d0d86c305d6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21098","senseId":"3","lemma":"분명하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"abbc940f03792a89","term":"도시","zh":"都市，城市","audio":"/audio/abbc940f03792a890e5d.mp3","entryId":"70743","definition":"成为政治、经济和文化的中心，且人口大量居住的地区。","pronunciation":["도시"]},{"id":"211966cafa483962","term":"건설","zh":"建立，成立","audio":"/audio/211966cafa48396207c5.mp3","entryId":"15888","definition":"新建国家或组织。","pronunciation":["건ː설"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"异常，反常，不正常","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"71168","definition":"与正常的不同。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"f9798826d0d86c30","term":"분명하다","zh":"肯定，分明，明明白白","audio":"/audio/f9798826d0d86c305d6f.mp3","entryId":"21098","definition":"事实准确无误。","pronunciation":["분명하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/07af5684cfe83e8f0eb7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.013,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15888","label":"